# defer_process_reap -- a deferred cleanup runs after the body, before return (README s15.6),
# proven via the standard.test harness. A module-global `phase` records order:
# the body sets it to 1, then the deferred cleanup overwrites it with 2. main
# calls the helper (whose defer fires at its return) and asserts phase == 2 --
# so the assertion fails if the cleanup did not run after the body.
#
# Expected output:
#   PASS  defer_process_reap  (expected 2, actual 2)
#   ---- 1 passed, 0 failed ----

DeferProcessReap is project
DeferProcessReap module examplesDeferProcessReap
DeferProcessReap target console
DeferProcessReap entry main

examplesDeferProcessReap is module
examplesDeferProcessReap path examples.deferProcessReap
examplesDeferProcessReap exports main
examplesDeferProcessReap purpose "Assert a deferred cleanup runs after the body"
examplesDeferProcessReap invariant "phase ends at 2 (body=1 then cleanup=2)"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

phase is storage
phase scope module
phase type Int64
phase mutability mutable
phase value 0
phase purpose "Records body-then-cleanup execution order"

markBody is operation
markBody out Int64
markBody memory heap no
markBody async no
markBody purpose "Record that the body ran (phase = 1)"
markBody let bodyMark immutable Int64 1
markBody let zeroRet immutable Int64 0
markBody set phase bodyMark
markBody return zeroRet

markCleanup is operation
markCleanup out Int64
markCleanup memory heap no
markCleanup async no
markCleanup purpose "Record that the deferred cleanup ran (phase = 2)"
markCleanup let cleanupMark immutable Int64 2
markCleanup let zeroRet immutable Int64 0
markCleanup set phase cleanupMark
markCleanup return zeroRet

runWithCleanup is operation
runWithCleanup out Int64
runWithCleanup memory heap no
runWithCleanup async no
runWithCleanup purpose "Run a body with a deferred cleanup"
runWithCleanup let zeroRet immutable Int64 0
runWithCleanup do acquire
runWithCleanup defer cleanupStep
runWithCleanup do runBody
runWithCleanup return zeroRet

acquire is call
acquire in runWithCleanup
acquire invokes acquireHandle
acquire out resourceHandle Int64
acquire owns resourceHandle
acquire cleanedBy cleanupStep

runBody is call
runBody in runWithCleanup
runBody invokes markBody
runBody out bodyRet Int64

cleanupStep is cleanup
cleanupStep in runWithCleanup
cleanupStep call cleanupCall
cleanupStep cleans resourceHandle

cleanupCall is call
cleanupCall in runWithCleanup
cleanupCall invokes markCleanup
cleanupCall discards "the cleanup-worker result is intentionally unused"

acquireHandle is operation
acquireHandle out Int64
acquireHandle memory heap no
acquireHandle async no
acquireHandle purpose "Return a placeholder resource handle"
acquireHandle invariant "Non-negative handle id"
acquireHandle let handleId immutable Int64 1
acquireHandle return handleId

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Run the deferred body and assert the cleanup ran after it"
main invariant "Asserts phase == 2 via the test harness"
main let harnessName immutable String "defer_process_reap"
main let harnessExpected immutable Int64 2
main let noopDecoy immutable Int64 0
main let noopName immutable String "defer_process_reap: real result (not the no-op 0)"
main do callHelper
main do checkOrder
main do noopCheck
main do harnessReport
main return harnessSummaryCode

callHelper is call
callHelper in main
callHelper invokes runWithCleanup
callHelper out helperRet Int64

checkOrder is call
checkOrder in main
checkOrder invokes test.assertEqualInt64
checkOrder arg name String harnessName
checkOrder arg expected Int64 harnessExpected
checkOrder arg actual Int64 phase

noopCheck is call
noopCheck in main
noopCheck invokes test.assertNotEqualInt64
noopCheck arg name String noopName
noopCheck arg expected Int64 noopDecoy
noopCheck arg actual Int64 phase

harnessReport is call
harnessReport in main
harnessReport invokes test.summary
harnessReport out harnessSummaryCode ExitCode
